EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
     Mount a CD-ROM on node _/_m_n_t_/_c_d_r_o_m:

           # mount -t cd9660 -r /dev/cd0a /mnt/cdrom

     Mount an MS-DOS USB stick with DUID 3eb7f9da875cb9ee on node _/_m_n_t_/_k_e_y:

           # mount -t msdos 3eb7f9da875cb9ee.i /mnt/key

     Graft a remote NFS file system on host _h_o_s_t, path _/_p_a_t_h_/_n_a_m_e, on node
     _/_m_n_t_/_n_f_s:

           # mount host:/path/name /mnt/nfs

     Remount _/_v_a_r with option “dev”:

           # mount -u -o dev /var

